  "goodToKnow": "Das Areal is a site or area of land, usually one with clear boundaries: das Firmenareal, das Messeareal, ein ehemaliges Kasernenareal (former barracks site). It's common in planning and news reports about redevelopment, as when old industrial Areale become new housing quarters. The everyday synonym is das Gelände. It's stressed on the last syllable, a-re-AAL, and comes from Latin area. Plural: die Areale."
